      "title": "radius-estimation-r2-0p68",
      "description": {
        "@type": "Item",
        "format": "text/plain",
        "content": "The pipeline's boundary-detection radius estimation achieves R²=0.68 against ground-truth simulated radii across >100,000 simulations spanning 0.5×–2× dilation/constriction, and remains stable under Gaussian noise up to a standard deviation of 200 signal units (image range 0–1023 SU)."
      },
