      "@id": "urn:uuid:e05b0913-66d9-4ac2-be33-40385aaf6181",
      "@type": "mira:Evidence",
      "title": "wt-controls-no-blue-green-difference",
      "description": {
        "@type": "Item",
        "format": "text/plain",
        "content": "Wild-type C57BL/6J mice (n=4) show no statistically distinguishable capillary radius distributions following blue (458 nm) versus green (552 nm) photostimulation, confirming that vascular responses in Thy1-ChR2 mice are ChR2-specific and not attributable to photothermal or non-specific light effects."
      },
      "sourceDocument": {
        "@id": "https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.95525",
